Package: molpathR
Title: Molecular Pathology Data Platform for Clinical NGS Integration
Description: A unified platform for ingesting, linking, querying, and visualizing
    molecular pathology data from heterogeneous sources including NGS files (FASTQ,
    BAM, VCF), XML variant interpretation reports, structured pathology PDF reports,
    pathology and clinical information systems, and survival outcome data. Provides
    a searchable in-memory database and an interactive Shiny application for clinical
    exploration and cohort analysis.
Version: 0.1.0
